## Installation

Follow the steps below to install LunaSVG using either [CMake](https://cmake.org/) or [Meson](https://mesonbuild.com/).

### Using CMake

```bash
git clone https://github.com/sammycage/lunasvg.git
cd lunasvg
cmake -B build .
